OL,3,GNEWSALibrary will not take Walliams
OL,4,Abooks off shelves
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey library will continue to
OL,7,Floan out books authored by David
OL,8,FWalliams after allegations of sexual
OL,9,Fmisconduct were made against him.
OL,11,FGuille-Alles Library, in St Peter Port,
OL,12,Fsaid literature should remain available
OL,13,Fto readers unless the content was
OL,14,Fillegal.
OL,16,FA spokesperson said "we recognise this
OL,17,Fis a sensitive and complex issue" but
OL,18,Fadded "we take seriously our
OL,19,Fresponsibility to protect people's
OL,20,Ffreedom to read what they want to
OL,21,Fread".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
